  "enhance_prompts": {
    "prompt": "structure: [subject, action, environment, lighting, style, quality]; rules:; - pair every bare noun with 1-2 visual adjectives; - name the camera or render view (e.g. \"3/4 view, 50mm, soft rim light\"); - end with the quality block, never open with it; - negations go to the negative prompt, never the positive; - one style axis per prompt; stacking contradictory styles muddies both",
    "lyrics": ""
  },
